**Choices I made:**
- The window's map is the brush surface, so no 3D picking was needed.
- The editor renders all tiles at LOD 0, so stitching is not exercised there.
- The window has no physics world, so its edits refresh meshes only.
- "New" discards an unsaved terrain without a prompt.
- Terrain is not drawn in the scene viewport yet.

